{"version_id": 66, "article_id": 7, "level_code": "ja_n5", "lang": "ja", "level": 1, "level_label": "N5 初級", "title": "ドイツの元スパイのリーダーがつかまる", "title_zh": "德国前情报头子被捕", "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c58jzyer1kr0o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/Helmut_Schmidt%2C_former_German_Chancellor.jpg", "credit": "No machine-readable author provided. Axel Sperl assumed (based on copyright clai · cc0 1.0 · via wikimedia"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 282, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "ドイツで、元スパイのリーダーがつかまりました。とても大きなニュースです。", "lead_zh": "德国前情报机构负责人被抓了。这是个大新闻。", "preview": "ドイツの元スパイのリーダー、アウグスト・ハンニングさんがつかまりました。スパイをしたという疑いがあります。", "preview_zh": "德国前情报机构负责人奥古斯特·汉宁被抓了。他涉嫌从事间谍活动。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 56, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@a79b424/content/audio/7/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 56.875, "size_bytes": 345024, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 176, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@a79b424/content/data/versions/66.json", "paragraphs": ["ドイツの元スパイのリーダー、アウグスト・ハンニングさんがつかまりました。スパイをしたという疑いがあります。", "ハンニングさんは1998年から2005年までBNDというスパイの組織のリーダーでした。その後は、相談の仕事をしていました。", "けいさつは、元BNDのマンフレート・Dさんもつかまえました。お金のために、2000まいのひみつの書類をハンニングさんにわたしたと言われています。", "ハンニングさんは水曜日に、マンフレート・Dさんは火曜日に、さばんに行きます。", "ハンニングさんは、ほかの国のスパイにじょうほうをわたしたと言われています。しかし、どの国かはわかりません。", "ハンニングさんは「やっていない」と言っています。けいさつは、いまも調べています。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["德国前情报机构负责人奥古斯特·汉宁被抓了。他涉嫌从事间谍活动。", "汉宁从1998年到2005年担任情报机构BND的负责人。之后他一直做顾问工作。", "警方还逮捕了BND前员工曼弗雷德·D。据称他为了钱，把2000份机密文件交给了汉宁。", "汉宁周三出庭，曼弗雷德·D周二出庭。", "据称汉宁把情报交给了另一个国家的情报机构。但具体是哪个国家，目前不清楚。", "汉宁说“我没做”。警方目前仍在调查。"], "body": "ドイツの元スパイのリーダー、アウグスト・ハンニングさんがつかまりました。スパイをしたという疑いがあります。\n\nハンニングさんは1998年から2005年までBNDというスパイの組織のリーダーでした。その後は、相談の仕事をしていました。\n\nけいさつは、元BNDのマンフレート・Dさんもつかまえました。お金のために、2000まいのひみつの書類をハンニングさんにわたしたと言われています。\n\nハンニングさんは水曜日に、マンフレート・Dさんは火曜日に、さばんに行きます。\n\nハンニングさんは、ほかの国のスパイにじょうほうをわたしたと言われています。しかし、どの国かはわかりません。\n\nハンニングさんは「やっていない」と言っています。けいさつは、いまも調べています。", "body_zh": "德国前情报机构负责人奥古斯特·汉宁被抓了。他涉嫌从事间谍活动。\n\n汉宁从1998年到2005年担任情报机构BND的负责人。之后他一直做顾问工作。\n\n警方还逮捕了BND前员工曼弗雷德·D。据称他为了钱，把2000份机密文件交给了汉宁。\n\n汉宁周三出庭，曼弗雷德·D周二出庭。\n\n据称汉宁把情报交给了另一个国家的情报机构。但具体是哪个国家，目前不清楚。\n\n汉宁说“我没做”。警方目前仍在调查。", "text": "ドイツの元スパイのリーダー、アウグスト・ハンニングさんがつかまりました。スパイをしたという疑いがあります。 ハンニングさんは1998年から2005年までBNDというスパイの組織のリーダーでした。その後は、相談の仕事をしていました。 けいさつは、元BNDのマンフレート・Dさんもつかまえました。お金のために、2000まいのひみつの書類をハンニングさんにわたしたと言われています。 ハンニングさんは水曜日に、マンフレート・Dさんは火曜日に、さばんに行きます。 ハンニングさんは、ほかの国のスパイにじょうほうをわたしたと言われています。しかし、どの国かはわかりません。 ハンニングさんは「やっていない」と言っています。けいさつは、いまも調べています。", "vocab": [{"word": "つかまる", "pos": "verb", "zh": "被抓、被捕", "note": "日常常用，比「逮捕される」简单"}, {"word": "スパイ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "间谍", "note": "外来语，直接使用"}, {"word": "元", "pos": "noun", "zh": "前、原", "note": "如「元リーダー」=前领导人"}, {"word": "リーダー", "pos": "noun", "zh": "领导人、头目", "note": "外来语"}, {"word": "ひみつ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "秘密、机密", "note": "可作名词或な形容词"}, {"word": "書類", "pos": "noun", "zh": "文件", "note": "常用词，注意读音しょるい"}, {"word": "お金", "pos": "noun", "zh": "钱", "note": "礼貌说法，比「金」更常用"}, {"word": "さばん", "pos": "noun", "zh": "法庭、审判", "note": "日常口语中也可说「裁判」"}], "title_original": "Former German spy chief arrested for espionage and treason", "summary_original": "August Hanning is accused of obtaining classified information for a foreign power.", "body_original": "Former German spy chief arrested for espionage and treason\nBy\nOlivia Ireland\nPublished\n6 hours ago\nFormer German spy chief August Hanning has been arrested on suspicion of espionage, treason and obtaining classified information for a foreign power, the German Federal Prosecutor's Office says.\nHanning headed the Federal Intelligence Service (BND) from 1998 to 2005 and has since been working as a private consultant.\nProsecutors allege that he used classified intelligence to \"draft an analysis\" for one foreign intelligence service and maintained contact with another foreign spying service. Investigators have not disclosed which foreign powers were involved.\nPolice also arrested former BND employee Manfred D, accusing him of passing Hanning about 2,000 classified documents for money.\nManfred D, who was Hanning's bureau chief and remained in the BND until this year, is charged with aiding and abetting attempted treason and treasonous espionage.\nLocal media reported Hanning was arrested at his home in Nordwalde near Münster while Manfred D was arrested in Bavaria. Hanning is due in court on Wednesday and Manfred D will appear on Tuesday.\nProsecutors say Manfred D, who also served as the chief of staff for Hanning's successors between 2012 and 2026, used his role to gain access to highly confidential information which he then passed on to Hanning \"in exchange for remuneration\".\n\"The current findings suggest that, over the years, Manfred D provided Hanning with approximately 2,000 documents, many of which contained classified information to be used exclusively by the Federal Intelligence Service for internal purposes,\" the statement says.\n\"On one occasion, Hanning used classified intelligence ... to draft an analysis for an officer of a foreign intelligence service,\" prosecutors said, noting it was not clear if \"the material reached the intended recipient\".\nHanning is also accused of being \"in close contact with a representative of another foreign intelligence service, to whom he passed on political information, partially based on material provided by Manfred D, for several years\".\nLocal media say Hanning's alleged possession of intelligence documents came to light during a separate case relating to German steakhouse heiress Christina Block.\nHamburg public prosecutor's office accused Block of orchestrating the kidnapping of her two youngest children in 2023 due to a custody dispute. Investigators allege Hanning was involved in an earlier attempted kidnapping of the children, which he denies.\nState criminal police officers reportedly discovered an electronic data storage device containing sensitive information including recent BND documents.\nIt is not the first time the BND has faced similar controversy. A high-ranking German intelligence officer was\ncharged with treason in 2023\nfor allegedly passing state secrets to Russia.\nProsecutors alleged Carsten L shared intelligence about the war in Ukraine and the Wagner mercenary group and received roughly €400,000 ($450,000; £340,000). His trial is ongoing.\nRelated topics\nGermany\nCorruption\nSpying\nMore on this story\nAlmost 60,000 far-right extremists in Germany, intelligence agency says\nPublished\n30 June\nGermany investigates Russia links to weapons cache discovered in woods, reports say\nPublished\n21 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-06T16:57:31.470498+00:00", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "ドイツ", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.487, "sm": 125, "em": 487, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "の", "s": 0.5, "e": 0.613, "sm": 500, "em": 612, "cs": 3, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "元", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.887, "sm": 625, "em": 887, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "スパイ", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.275, "sm": 900, "em": 1275, "cs": 5, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "の", "s": 1.288, "e": 1.388, "sm": 1287, "em": 1387, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "リーダー", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.85, "sm": 1400, "em": 1849, "cs": 9, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "、", "s": 1.85, "e": 2.125, "sm": 1849, "em": 2125, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "アウグスト", "s": 2.125, "e": 2.925, "sm": 2125, "em": 2925, "cs": 14, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "・", "s": 2.925, "e": 3.237, "sm": 2925, "em": 3237, "cs": 19, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "ハンニング", "s": 3.237, "e": 3.775, "sm": 3237, "em": 3775, "cs": 20, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "さん", "s": 3.788, "e": 3.988, "sm": 3787, "em": 3987, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "が", "s": 4.0, "e": 4.112, "sm": 4000, "em": 4112, "cs": 